{"4696740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Body Kounts", "steam_appid": 4696740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5084940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Game your characters will have to put their lives on the line and resurrect already extinct beasts in  an alternate realm to do battle in a winner take ALL series of mind games.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696740/extras/a5648f0a309e31e276f6a0d037159aeb.poster.avif?t=1787280613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696740/extras/a5648f0a309e31e276f6a0d037159aeb.webm?t=1787280613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696740/extras/a5648f0a309e31e276f6a0d037159aeb.mp4?t=1787280613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Features and modes are readily available to the player, Including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A single player Campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Item upgrades and Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A rich bestiary that is immediately available to experiment with...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Online Play PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Skill based rewards and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers an innovative, action packed and graphically compelling interpretation of ancient table top games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696740/extras/dff990dd2ce9597febe52eb92ffae00e.poster.avif?t=1787280613\" width=720 height=372 ><source src=\"h